Package: ClinicalFiguresR
Type: Package
Title: Standardized Clinical Trial Figures from ADaM-Style Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Chancy", "Mampouya Clark", email = "ton.email@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides reusable functions for standardized clinical trial
    visualizations and simple treatment comparisons using ADaM-style data.
    The package currently supports adverse-event summaries, longitudinal
    alanine aminotransferase profiles, change-from-baseline comparisons,
    and forest plots with confidence intervals and p-values.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
